delete.description:
Soft-delete an email account (B-18). Stalwart auth is suspended;
rows stay in place for the grace window; restore is possible until
purge_due_accounts fires.

post.description:
Run filter conditions against the CALLER-TENANT's messages and preview.

Body: {
    "conditions": [{field, operator, value}, ...],
    "match_type": "all" | "any",
    "mailbox_id": "..." (optional — restrict to one mailbox; must belong
                         to the caller's tenant, 404 otherwise),
    "limit": 1000  (optional — scan window)
}

Returns: {"count": N, "sample": [first 10 matching messages]}

Start a website scan. Creates a WebsiteScan entity and launches the
12-step pipeline as a background task.

Body: {url, scan_type?, max_pages?, crawl_delay_ms?, respect_robots?, party_id?, company_id?}

Fast clone: download a page as self-contained HTML.

Body: {"url": "https://example.com"}
Returns: {"clone_id": "...", "clone_url": "/api/website/original/{clone_id}/home"}

This skips the full 14-step scan pipeline. Just downloads the page
with all assets inlined. Takes ~30-60 seconds, not hours.
